  "body": "Found while running the site tests for #1904 (`python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests`). Three failures on upstream main at 4e8616b81, with no change of mine (also noted in PR #2342's body):\n\n- `test_first_4axis_part.FirstFourAxisPart.test_machine_and_post_are_the_shipped_ones`: it looks for `\"Tormach 770MX + microARC 4\"` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs`, and the name is no longer there.\n- `test_guide_icons.GuideIcons.test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app` (two failures): `site/static/icons/tool-wire.png` is missing, and the icon sets of the app and the site differ.\n\nNothing runs these tests on a PR, so they stay red without notice.\n\nDone means: `python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests` is green on main (the test reads the machine name from where it now lives; the site icon set matches the app's).\n",
